sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as User (Browser / React SPA)
    participant F as JwtAuthFilter
    participant AC as AuthController
    participant AS as AuthService
    participant SVC as Domain Controller + Service
    participant R as Repository (JPA)
    participant DB as MySQL 8

    Note over U,DB: 1. Authentication (stateless login)
    U->>AC: POST /api/auth/login {username, password}
    AC->>AS: authenticate(credentials)
    AS->>R: findByUsername(username)
    R->>DB: SELECT * FROM users
    DB-->>R: user row (password_hash)
    R-->>AS: User
    AS->>AS: BCrypt.matches(password, hash)
    alt invalid credentials
        AS-->>U: 401 Unauthorized (sanitized)
    else valid
        AS->>AS: issue HS256 JWT (username, roles)
        AS-->>U: 200 { token, roles, permissions }
    end

    Note over U,DB: 2. Authenticated request (every call re-authenticates)
    U->>F: GET /api/prisoners  (Authorization: Bearer <JWT>)
    F->>F: validate JWT signature + expiry
    F->>F: load authorities (26 permissions)
    F->>SVC: forward with SecurityContext
    SVC->>SVC: @PreAuthorize("hasAuthority('PRISONER_READ')")
    alt lacks permission
        SVC-->>U: 403 Forbidden
    else authorized
        SVC->>R: findAll(Specification, Pageable)
        R->>DB: SELECT ... WHERE ... LIMIT/OFFSET
        DB-->>R: rows
        R-->>SVC: Page<Prisoner>
        SVC-->>U: 200 PageResponse<PrisonerDTO> (JSON)
    end
